    "https://candidate.aurion.cloud/acu/production/career/vacancies/2912147452272599~1/edit": {
      "title": "National Manager, Payroll Services",
      "description": "Closing Date: 01/11/2026 Department: Payroll Services Location: NSW,QLD Campus Location: Brisbane, Australia Job No: APTAV134376#003 Exceptional national payroll leadership opportunity to manage ACU's payroll function, provide expert advice and ensure compliance Lead a high performing team delivering crucial People & Culture and payroll services ACU offers 17% employer superannuation, salary packaging and generous leave provisions Full time, fixed term 15 month opportunity with some hybrid flexibility working at North Sydney or Brisbane campus About the role: Operating within Payroll Services , the National Manager, Payroll Services operates in a complex industrial and regulatory environment and leads a team of payroll specialists delivering accurate and timely fortnightly payroll, workers compensation, superannuation, taxation and related third-party payment services for ACU nationally. Reporting to the Associate Director - Workforce Systems, Reporting & Payroll the position has responsibility for managing the end to end payroll function, providing expert advice on payroll related matters and ensuring ongoing compliance with relevant ACU policies and industrial, external regulatory, Federation and State Government legislative requirements. The National Manager, Payroll Services will drive high standards of performance within the Payroll Services team building a culture of continuous improvement and service excellence enabling timely resolution of all payroll queries and supporting effective stewardship of university resources. The National Manager, Payroll Services will have demonstrated experience in Aurion Payroll & HR Solutions, expertise in managing payroll systems and ability to manage a complex fortnightly payroll. For full position details, refer to the position description Contact: General enquiries can be sent to Steve Dobson, Associate Director - Workforce Systems, Payroll & Reporting at: steve.dobson@acu.edu.au What we offer: The Un